{
  "spec": {
    "title": "CSS Overscroll Behavior Module Level 2",
    "url": "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/"
  },
  "algorithms": [
    {
      "html": "Every <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area②⑨\">overscroll area</a> <var>area</var> is laid out and snapped within its <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area-parent\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area-parent①⑥\">overscroll area parent</a> <var>scroller</var> as follows:",
      "rationale": "if",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>If <var>area</var>’s specified <a class=\"css property\" data-link-type=\"property\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-position-3/#propdef-position\" id=\"ref-for-propdef-position①\">position</a> is not <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-position-3/#valdef-position-absolute\" id=\"ref-for-valdef-position-absolute\">absolute</a> or <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-position-3/#valdef-position-fixed\" id=\"ref-for-valdef-position-fixed\">fixed</a>, its computed <span class=\"property\" id=\"ref-for-propdef-position②\">position</span> is <span class=\"css\" id=\"ref-for-valdef-position-absolute①\">absolute</span>.\nIf <var>area</var>’s specified <a class=\"css property\" data-link-type=\"property\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-display-4/#propdef-display\" id=\"ref-for-propdef-display①\">display</a> is <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-display-4/#valdef-display-contents\" id=\"ref-for-valdef-display-contents\">contents</a>, its computed <span class=\"property\" id=\"ref-for-propdef-display②\">display</span> is <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-display-4/#valdef-display-block\" id=\"ref-for-valdef-display-block\">block</a>; otherwise its <span class=\"property\" id=\"ref-for-propdef-display③\">display</span> is <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-display-4/#blockify\" id=\"ref-for-blockify\">blockified</a>.\n<var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-display-4/#containing-block\" id=\"ref-for-containing-block②\">containing block</a> is <var>scroller</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-position-4/#local-containing-block\" id=\"ref-for-local-containing-block①\">local containing block</a>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p><var>scroller</var> is a <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-1/#scroll-snap-container\" id=\"ref-for-scroll-snap-container\">scroll snap container</a> (<a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"propdesc\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-1/#propdef-scroll-snap-type\" id=\"ref-for-propdef-scroll-snap-type\">scroll-snap-type: pair mandatory</a>) that ignores <a class=\"css property\" data-link-type=\"property\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-1/#propdef-scroll-snap-align\" id=\"ref-for-propdef-scroll-snap-align\">scroll-snap-align</a> on descendants and establishes two <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-1/#scroll-snap-area\" id=\"ref-for-scroll-snap-area\">scroll snap areas</a>:</p>\n     <ul>\n      <li data-md=\"\">\n       <p>An initial <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-1/#scroll-snap-area\" id=\"ref-for-scroll-snap-area①\">scroll snap area</a> equal to the rectangle of <var>scroller</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overflow-3/#scrollport\" id=\"ref-for-scrollport④\">scrollport</a> at scroll offset <code>(0, 0)</code>, with <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"propdesc\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-1/#propdef-scroll-snap-align\" id=\"ref-for-propdef-scroll-snap-align①\">scroll-snap-align: center</a> and <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"propdesc\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-1/#propdef-scroll-snap-stop\" id=\"ref-for-propdef-scroll-snap-stop\">scroll-snap-stop: always</a>. This is <var>scroller</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overflow-3/#initial-scroll-position\" id=\"ref-for-initial-scroll-position\">initial scroll position</a>.</p>\n      </li><li data-md=\"\">\n       <p>A target <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-1/#scroll-snap-area\" id=\"ref-for-scroll-snap-area②\">scroll snap area</a> equal to <var>area</var>’s border box, with <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"propdesc\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-1/#propdef-scroll-snap-align\" id=\"ref-for-propdef-scroll-snap-align②\">scroll-snap-align: center</a> and <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"propdesc\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-1/#propdef-scroll-snap-stop\" id=\"ref-for-propdef-scroll-snap-stop①\">scroll-snap-stop: normal</a>.</p>\n     </li></ul>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "html": "When an <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-container\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-container①⑧\">overscroll container</a> <var>container</var> has <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area③②\">overscroll areas</a> <var>area</var><sub>1</sub>, <var>area</var><sub>2</sub>, …, <var>area</var><sub><var>n</var></sub> in <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-shadow-1/#flat-tree\" id=\"ref-for-flat-tree①\">flat tree</a> order, with corresponding <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area-parent\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area-parent①⑦\">overscroll area parent</a> boxes <var>scroller</var><sub>1</sub>, <var>scroller</var><sub>2</sub>, …, <var>scroller</var><sub><var>n</var></sub>:",
      "rationale": "if",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>All <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area-parent\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area-parent①⑧\">overscroll area parent</a> boxes of <var>container</var> are stacked and painted after <var>container</var>’s in-flow and positioned descendants, in reverse <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-shadow-1/#flat-tree\" id=\"ref-for-flat-tree②\">flat tree</a> order:\n<var>scroller</var><sub><var>n</var></sub> paints first (immediately above <var>container</var>’s regular content), followed by <var>scroller</var><sub><var>n</var>−1</sub>, …, <var>scroller</var><sub>1</sub>, with <var>scroller</var><sub>1</sub> painting last (on top of all other content in <var>container</var>).</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Transform hierarchy:</p>\n     <ul>\n      <li data-md=\"\">\n       <p>If <var>container</var>’s computed <a class=\"css property\" data-link-type=\"property\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#propdef-overscroll-container-type\" id=\"ref-for-propdef-overscroll-container-type⑥\">overscroll-container-type</a> is <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#valdef-overscroll-container-type-overlay\" id=\"ref-for-valdef-overscroll-container-type-overlay\">overlay</a>, each <var>scroller</var><sub><var>k</var></sub>’s scroll translation applies only to <var>scroller</var><sub><var>k</var></sub>’s own children (<var>area</var><sub><var>k</var></sub>’s <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#selectordef-overscroll-backdrop\" id=\"ref-for-selectordef-overscroll-backdrop⑦\">::overscroll-backdrop</a> and <var>area</var><sub><var>k</var></sub>).</p>\n      </li><li data-md=\"\">\n       <p>If <var>container</var>’s computed <a class=\"css property\" data-link-type=\"property\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#propdef-overscroll-container-type\" id=\"ref-for-propdef-overscroll-container-type⑦\">overscroll-container-type</a> is <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#valdef-overscroll-container-type-push\" id=\"ref-for-valdef-overscroll-container-type-push②\">push</a> or <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#valdef-overscroll-container-type-auto\" id=\"ref-for-valdef-overscroll-container-type-auto①\">auto</a>, each <var>scroller</var><sub><var>k</var></sub>’s scroll translation also applies to <var>scroller</var><sub><var>k</var>+1</sub> … <var>scroller</var><sub><var>n</var></sub> and to <var>container</var>’s content (offset by <var>scroller</var><sub><var>k</var></sub>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overflow-3/#scroll-origin\" id=\"ref-for-scroll-origin①\">scroll origin</a>). Consequently, scrolling <var>scroller</var><sub><var>k</var></sub> translates <var>container</var>’s regular content and any lower <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area③③\">overscroll areas</a> by the same scroll offset.</p>\n     </li></ul>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "scroll chain",
      "href": "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#scroll-chain",
      "html": "A <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-noexport=\"\" id=\"scroll-chain\">scroll chain</dfn> is the order in which scrolling is propagated from one <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overflow-3/#scroll-container\" id=\"ref-for-scroll-container①②\">scroll container</a> to another:",
      "rationale": "for",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>For an <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-container\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-container②①\">overscroll container</a> <var>container</var> with <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area③⑤\">overscroll areas</a> <var>area</var><sub>1</sub>, <var>area</var><sub>2</sub>, …, <var>area</var><sub><var>n</var></sub> in <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-shadow-1/#flat-tree\" id=\"ref-for-flat-tree③\">flat tree</a> order and corresponding <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area-parent\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area-parent②①\">overscroll area parent</a> boxes <var>scroller</var><sub>1</sub>, <var>scroller</var><sub>2</sub>, …, <var>scroller</var><sub><var>n</var></sub>, the scroll parent links between <var>container</var> and <var>container</var>’s nearest ancestor <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overflow-3/#scroll-container\" id=\"ref-for-scroll-container①③\">scroll container</a> <var>ancestor</var> are ordered as:</p>\n     <p style=\"text-align: center\"><var>container</var> → <var>scroller</var><sub><var>n</var></sub> → <var>scroller</var><sub><var>n</var>−1</sub> → … → <var>scroller</var><sub>1</sub> → <var>ancestor</var></p>\n     \nConsequently:\n\n     <ul>\n      <li data-md=\"\">\n       <p>A scroll reaching the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#scroll-boundary\" id=\"ref-for-scroll-boundary⑤\">scroll boundary</a> of <var>container</var> chains in reverse <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-shadow-1/#flat-tree\" id=\"ref-for-flat-tree④\">flat tree</a> (Last-In, First-Out) order: first to <var>scroller</var><sub><var>n</var></sub> (the last <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area③⑥\">overscroll area</a> in <span id=\"ref-for-flat-tree⑤\">flat tree</span> order), then to <var>scroller</var><sub><var>n</var>−1</sub>, and so on up to <var>scroller</var><sub>1</sub>, before chaining to <var>ancestor</var>.</p>\n      </li><li data-md=\"\">\n       <p>A scroll originating within <var>area</var><sub><var>k</var></sub> (or on <var>area</var><sub><var>k</var></sub>’s <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#selectordef-overscroll-backdrop\" id=\"ref-for-selectordef-overscroll-backdrop⑨\">::overscroll-backdrop</a>) chains to <var>scroller</var><sub><var>k</var></sub>, then to <var>scroller</var><sub><var>k</var>−1</sub>, …, <var>scroller</var><sub>1</sub>, and then to <var>ancestor</var>.</p>\n     </li></ul>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>For any other <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overflow-3/#scroll-container\" id=\"ref-for-scroll-container①④\">scroll container</a>, the next link in its <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#scroll-chain\" id=\"ref-for-scroll-chain③\">scroll chain</a> is the nearest ancestor <span id=\"ref-for-scroll-container①⑤\">scroll container</span> (or <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-container\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-container②②\">overscroll container</a>) in the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-display-4/#containing-block-chain\" id=\"ref-for-containing-block-chain\">containing block chain</a> that is scrollable in the scroll’s axis.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>The <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css2/#viewport\" id=\"ref-for-viewport\">viewport</a> participates in <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#scroll-chaining\" id=\"ref-for-scroll-chaining③\">scroll chaining</a> as the document’s <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view-1/#dom-document-scrollingelement\" id=\"ref-for-dom-document-scrollingelement\">scrollingElement</a></code>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "enqueue overscrollstart",
      "html": "When an <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area③⑨\">overscroll area</a> <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area-parent\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area-parent②⑥\">overscroll area parent</a> begins a scroll or snap change while <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#active-overscroll-flag\" id=\"ref-for-active-overscroll-flag①\">active overscroll flag</a> is <code>false</code>:",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>Set <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#active-overscroll-flag\" id=\"ref-for-active-overscroll-flag②\">active overscroll flag</a> to <code>true</code>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Append an <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscrollevent\" id=\"ref-for-overscrollevent⑤\">OverscrollEvent</a></code> named <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#eventdef-overscrollevent-overscrollstart\" id=\"ref-for-eventdef-overscrollevent-overscrollstart①\">overscrollstart</a></code> with target set to <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-container\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-container③⑥\">overscroll container</a>, <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#dom-overscrollevent-overscrolltarget\" id=\"ref-for-dom-overscrollevent-overscrolltarget\">overscrollTarget</a></code> set to <var>area</var>, and <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#dom-overscrollevent-overscrolling\" id=\"ref-for-dom-overscrollevent-overscrolling\">overscrolling</a></code> set to <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscrolling-state\" id=\"ref-for-overscrolling-state②\">overscrolling state</a> to the document’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view-1/#document-pending-scroll-events\" id=\"ref-for-document-pending-scroll-events\">pending scroll events</a>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "enqueue overscrollchanging",
      "html": "When an <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area④⓪\">overscroll area</a> <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area-parent\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area-parent②⑦\">overscroll area parent</a> <var>scroller</var> updates its <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-2/#eventual-snap-target\" id=\"ref-for-eventual-snap-target①\">eventual snap target</a> while <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#active-overscroll-flag\" id=\"ref-for-active-overscroll-flag③\">active overscroll flag</a> is <code>true</code>:",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>Let <var>isOverscrolling</var> be <code>true</code> if <var>scroller</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-2/#eventual-snap-target\" id=\"ref-for-eventual-snap-target②\">eventual snap target</a> is <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-1/#scroll-snap-area\" id=\"ref-for-scroll-snap-area④\">scroll snap area</a>, and <code>false</code> otherwise.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Set <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscrolling-state\" id=\"ref-for-overscrolling-state③\">overscrolling state</a> to <var>isOverscrolling</var>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Append an <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscrollevent\" id=\"ref-for-overscrollevent⑥\">OverscrollEvent</a></code> named <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#eventdef-overscrollevent-overscrollchanging\" id=\"ref-for-eventdef-overscrollevent-overscrollchanging①\">overscrollchanging</a></code> with target set to <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-container\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-container③⑦\">overscroll container</a>, <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#dom-overscrollevent-overscrolltarget\" id=\"ref-for-dom-overscrollevent-overscrolltarget①\">overscrollTarget</a></code> set to <var>area</var>, and <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#dom-overscrollevent-overscrolling\" id=\"ref-for-dom-overscrollevent-overscrolling①\">overscrolling</a></code> set to <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscrolling-state\" id=\"ref-for-overscrolling-state④\">overscrolling state</a> to the document’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view-1/#document-pending-scroll-events\" id=\"ref-for-document-pending-scroll-events①\">pending scroll events</a>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "enqueue overscroll finished",
      "html": "When a scrolling operation on an <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area④①\">overscroll area</a> <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area-parent\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area-parent②⑧\">overscroll area parent</a> <var>scroller</var> is <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view-1/#scroll-completed\" id=\"ref-for-scroll-completed\">completed</a> while <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#active-overscroll-flag\" id=\"ref-for-active-overscroll-flag④\">active overscroll flag</a> is <code>true</code>:",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>Set <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#active-overscroll-flag\" id=\"ref-for-active-overscroll-flag⑤\">active overscroll flag</a> to <code>false</code>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Let <var>type</var> be <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#eventdef-overscrollevent-overscrollend\" id=\"ref-for-eventdef-overscrollevent-overscrollend①\">overscrollend</a></code> if <var>scroller</var>’s realized <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-2/#snap-target\" id=\"ref-for-snap-target\">snap target</a> changed from the <span id=\"ref-for-snap-target①\">snap target</span> prior to <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#eventdef-overscrollevent-overscrollstart\" id=\"ref-for-eventdef-overscrollevent-overscrollstart②\">overscrollstart</a></code>, and <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#eventdef-overscrollevent-overscrollcancel\" id=\"ref-for-eventdef-overscrollevent-overscrollcancel①\">overscrollcancel</a></code> otherwise.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Append an <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscrollevent\" id=\"ref-for-overscrollevent⑦\">OverscrollEvent</a></code> named <var>type</var> with target set to <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-container\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-container③⑧\">overscroll container</a>, <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#dom-overscrollevent-overscrolltarget\" id=\"ref-for-dom-overscrollevent-overscrolltarget②\">overscrollTarget</a></code> set to <var>area</var>, and <code class=\"idl\"><a data-link-type=\"idl\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#dom-overscrollevent-overscrolling\" id=\"ref-for-dom-overscrollevent-overscrolling②\">overscrolling</a></code> set to <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscrolling-state\" id=\"ref-for-overscrolling-state⑤\">overscrolling state</a> to the document’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view-1/#document-pending-scroll-events\" id=\"ref-for-document-pending-scroll-events②\">pending scroll events</a>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "open the overscroll area",
      "href": "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#open-the-overscroll-area",
      "html": "To <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-noexport=\"\" id=\"open-the-overscroll-area\">open the overscroll area</dfn> <var>area</var>:",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>Let <var>scroller</var> be <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area-parent\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area-parent②⑨\">overscroll area parent</a>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Let <var>offset</var> be the <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-1/#scroll-snap-position\" id=\"ref-for-scroll-snap-position\">scroll snap position</a> of <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-1/#scroll-snap-area\" id=\"ref-for-scroll-snap-area⑤\">scroll snap area</a> in <var>scroller</var> along the axis with the larger scroll distance from <code>(0, 0)</code>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p><a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view-1/#perform-a-scroll\" id=\"ref-for-perform-a-scroll\">Perform a scroll</a> of <var>scroller</var> to <var>offset</var> with behavior set to <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overflow-3/#valdef-scroll-behavior-auto\" id=\"ref-for-valdef-scroll-behavior-auto\">auto</a>, updating <var>scroller</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-2/#snap-target\" id=\"ref-for-snap-target②\">snap target</a> to <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-1/#scroll-snap-area\" id=\"ref-for-scroll-snap-area⑥\">scroll snap area</a>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "close the overscroll area",
      "href": "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#close-the-overscroll-area",
      "html": "To <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-noexport=\"\" id=\"close-the-overscroll-area\">close the overscroll area</dfn> <var>area</var>:",
      "rationale": ".algorithm",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>Let <var>scroller</var> be <var>area</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area-parent\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area-parent③⓪\">overscroll area parent</a>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p><a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view-1/#perform-a-scroll\" id=\"ref-for-perform-a-scroll①\">Perform a scroll</a> of <var>scroller</var> to <code>(0, 0)</code> with behavior set to <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overflow-3/#valdef-scroll-behavior-auto\" id=\"ref-for-valdef-scroll-behavior-auto①\">auto</a>, updating <var>scroller</var>’s <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-2/#snap-target\" id=\"ref-for-snap-target③\">snap target</a> to the initial <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-1/#scroll-snap-area\" id=\"ref-for-scroll-snap-area⑦\">scroll snap area</a>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "html": "In addition, an element <var>node</var> inside an <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-container\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-container③⑨\">overscroll container</a> <var>container</var> is subject to the following <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#inert\" id=\"ref-for-inert③\">inert</a> rules:",
      "rationale": "if",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>If <var>node</var> is an <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area⑤④\">overscroll area</a> of <var>container</var> that matches <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#selectordef-overscroll-open\" id=\"ref-for-selectordef-overscroll-open⑤\">:overscroll-open</a>, and another <span id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area⑤⑤\">overscroll area</span> of <var>container</var> preceding <var>node</var> in <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-shadow-1/#flat-tree\" id=\"ref-for-flat-tree⑥\">flat tree</a> order also matches <span class=\"css\" id=\"ref-for-selectordef-overscroll-open⑥\">:overscroll-open</span>, <var>node</var> and its <span id=\"ref-for-flat-tree⑦\">flat tree</span> subtree are <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#inert\" id=\"ref-for-inert④\">inert</a>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>If any <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area⑤⑥\">overscroll area</a> of <var>container</var> matches <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#selectordef-overscroll-open\" id=\"ref-for-selectordef-overscroll-open⑦\">:overscroll-open</a>, every <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-shadow-1/#flat-tree\" id=\"ref-for-flat-tree⑧\">flat tree</a> child of <var>container</var> that is not an <span id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area⑤⑦\">overscroll area</span> (and its <span id=\"ref-for-flat-tree⑨\">flat tree</span> subtree) is <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#inert\" id=\"ref-for-inert⑤\">inert</a>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>If <var>node</var> is a <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#button-command-overscroll-toggle-invoker\" id=\"ref-for-button-command-overscroll-toggle-invoker④\">toggle invoker</a> or <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#button-command-overscroll-show-invoker\" id=\"ref-for-button-command-overscroll-show-invoker③\">show invoker</a> whose target is an <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#overscroll-area\" id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area⑤⑧\">overscroll area</a> <var>area</var> of <var>container</var> in the same <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-scope\" id=\"ref-for-concept-tree-scope④\">tree scope</a>, and <var>node</var> is a <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-shadow-1/#flat-tree\" id=\"ref-for-flat-tree①⓪\">flat tree</a> descendant of <var>area</var>, then while <var>area</var> matches <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#selectordef-overscroll-closed\" id=\"ref-for-selectordef-overscroll-closed⑦\">:overscroll-closed</a>, <var>node</var> (and its <span id=\"ref-for-flat-tree①①\">flat tree</span> subtree) escapes the <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"propdesc\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-ui-4/#propdef-interactivity\" id=\"ref-for-propdef-interactivity③\">interactivity: inert</a> of <var>area</var>, provided <var>container</var> itself is not <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#inert\" id=\"ref-for-inert⑥\">inert</a> and no <span id=\"ref-for-overscroll-area⑤⑨\">overscroll area</span> of <var>container</var> preceding <var>area</var> in <span id=\"ref-for-flat-tree①②\">flat tree</span> order matches <a class=\"css\" data-link-type=\"maybe\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overscroll-2/#selectordef-overscroll-open\" id=\"ref-for-selectordef-overscroll-open⑧\">:overscroll-open</a>.</p>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}